#: rsiwidget.cpp:94
msgid ""
"Changes in RSIBreak 0.5.0\n"
"\n"
"In this version we have changed the way the timers work. Instead of indicating "
"the number of short breaks you want to take before taking a long break, you can "
"now setup how often, in minutes, you want a long break.\n"
"Please review your current settings.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""
"Cámbios en RSIBreak 0.5.0\n"
"\n"
"Nesta versión cambiamos o xeito de traballar do temporizador. No canto de "
"indicar o número de pausas curtas que quer ter antes dunha longa, agora pode "
"configurar con que frecuéncia, en minutos, desexa un descanso longo.\n"
"Revise a sua configurazón actual.\n"
"\n"

