#: setupmaximized.cpp:151 setuptiming.cpp:123
msgid "Slideshow"
msgstr "Apresentazón"

#: setupmaximized.cpp:158
msgid ""
"Select the folder from which you want to see images. These images are randomly "
"shown during the breaks. It will be searched recursively if you want..."
msgstr ""
"Escolla o cartafol do cal quere ver as imaxes. Esta imaxes son mostradas "
